ng in the field will say to him, ‘Come at once and sit down to eat’?","17:8":"Instead, won’t he tell him, ‘Prepare my meal and dress yourself to serve me while I eat and drink, and afterward you may eat and drink’?","17:9":"Does he thank the servant because he did what he was told?","17:10":"So you also, when you have done everything commanded of you, should say, ‘We are unworthy servants; we have only done our duty.’”"}}},"pairs":{},"minor":[]}